--TEST--
An extension whose manifest declares a `secret` return does not load, so no program runs against it — `rule:security/secret-does-not-cross-an-extension`
--EXTENSION--
vault
--FILE--
<?nvs
// `Shop\Vault` declares that `token` returns a secret value.
// The extension does not load, so this program never runs.
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0652]: The extension `%svault.nvsx` does not load: the return of `token` is declared `secret`, and a `secret` value never crosses an extension boundary
%A
